WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.380
I hate the army.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.040
So do I.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.110
Taking orders too.

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.480
I'll fly the skies with this beauty.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.320
Get away from her!

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.240
Don't you lay a finger on my plane!

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.160
Commander Arad, are you seriously trying to recruit this walking disaster?

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.740
I recall telling you not to take the battlefield lightly.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.630
I don't care much for swinging big guns around.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.250
I'm here to fly.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.520
Oh, you want to fly?

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.970
Well, then...

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.600
Are you enjoying the skies yet?

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:45.440
I'm loving it.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.660
Do you get it now?

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.920
Mirage, that's exactly why I'm assigning you to be Cadet Hayate's training officer.

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:07.430
What?

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.790
I want him up to speed in a month.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.500
Wait, Captain Arad!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:20.350
The skies... are waiting... for—

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:22.060
Hold on, don't—

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:29.060
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.920
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:35.780
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:46.580
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:52.050
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:55.590
<i>It doesn't matter if I blame it all on you,</i>

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.340
<i>swallowing back my tears</i>

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:03.180
<i>I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.390
<i>Reach out</i>

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.730
<i>Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.640
<i>Reach out</i>

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:09.870
<i>Until you can take flight</i>

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.360
<i>To the ends</i>

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:12.190
<i>Deep in my heart</i>

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.980
<i>Of time</i>

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.780
<i>There is a prayer</i>

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:17.700
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.800
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.950
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.710
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:33.290
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.920
<i>My body almost forgot</i>

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.930
<i>My heart kept beating loudly</i>

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:44.360
<i>Escape your chains, they're all but a dream</i>

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:51.070
<i>Tear them off and come at me, just like that</i>

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.840
He kept making fun of how I'd fail.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:07.250
Gotta show Hayate that I'm still here, alright!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.320
What?

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:11.760
Hayate!

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.420
Hi.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.880
You're still on Ragna?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.320
What's up with the uniform?

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:21.140
I joined the Delta platoon.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.420
What? Really?

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:25.750
I heard about the audition.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.590
Aren't you the lucky one?

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:34.560
Sorry for the wait, Freyja.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:35.630
Shall we get going?

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:36.690
Fo' sho!

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:44.670
Kaname, why don't I come over with a plate of delicious local jellyfish dumpling—

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.710
Sorry, our dorms are female-only.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:48.830
Figures.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:53.960
Wow, I guess I'll be living in this city now.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.800
I didn't expect this either.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.010
Sign: Ragnyannyan

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:06.720
Welcome to my humble abode and male quarters of the Delta Platoon: Ragnyannyan.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.560
Ragnyannyan?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.390
Bro!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:13.100
Welcome home!

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:14.730
It's those kids!

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.730
The phone thief!

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.460
Thief?

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.440
Thief!

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.860
Well, I just...

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.140
How's that right? You guys put it on her—

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.680
A mercat?!

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.150
What the hell?!

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:30.940
That's my dinner!

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.210
Cheeky kitty.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.620
You again?!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.560
Hold it!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.170
Chuck, it's yours!

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.340
Aloha!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.350
Ouch...

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.820
What the hell? I didn't do jack shit to you!

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.790
Freaking mercat...

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.850
Are you okay?

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.660
Are you allergic to cats by any chance?

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.630
I'm not letting it get away next time!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:19.690
You're in my way.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.340
Oh, you.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:24.120
Messer!

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.310
Welcome home!

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:26.590
My fish!

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.920
Home?

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.840
Oh. We're roommates.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.720
Great timing. Wanna have dinner with us?

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:37.000
I'll pass. I already ate.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:39.670
I see. Next time then.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.680
Kanakana, thanks for the meal!

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:49.910
See you tomorrow.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.690
I'm stuffed!

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.370
Be careful on your way back!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.830
Those two live together, you see.

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.920
What about Mikumo?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.880
Good question. I don't know either.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.120
The Mysterious Venus lives up to her name.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:16.060
I hope I got rid of the stink.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:20.430
You're from the Delta Platoon... Mirage!

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:22.310
I'll be in your care!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.520
Hi there!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:23.520
We're back.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:25.430
How was the boy?

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:27.700
Hayate Immelmann...

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:31.260
The commander scouted him personally.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.490
He's pretty amazing, isn't he?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.560
Absolutely not!

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.020
His case is beyond hopeless.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.000
He has no talent at all!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:45.810
Now that you live here, there are a few rules you must follow.

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.520
We take turns taking the trash out in the morning,

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.700
cleaning, cooking, doing the laundry, shopping,

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.870
buying snacks, and taking care of Querule.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.350
Th-That's a lot to remember.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.140
I'll make sure that you do.

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:02.020
<i>Where did he go?</i>

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:04.820
Cadet Hayate Immelmann! Show yourself!

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:06.970
He ain't here.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:09.350
Lost him again?

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:13.790
Poor Mirage.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:16.370
I heard he's skipped almost everything since day one.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.250
He didn't even show up for Captain Ernest's judo class.

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:27.710
The new Walkure girl isn't doing so hot either.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.790
Let's just hope things will work out.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:39.310
Hayate Immelmann!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:39.680
Oh?

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:41.770
Can we get going?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.290
VF-1EX.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:52.810
It was the first VF model to be deployed by the Spacy

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:56.280
and the base for all later models.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:01.120
The upgraded EX is perfectly suited for training.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.120
In one word: cute!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.430
Hayate's all the way up there?

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:07.880
I can't lose!

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:09.350
Listen up, rookie!

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:10.760
Let's start from the basics.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.320
Rightward turn!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.890
Handle right. Back. Adjust rudder. Hold. Raise thrust.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.850
Right, huh?

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.560
Idiot! Straighten up!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.520
That's too much!

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:33.200
Now do you get why classes are important?

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.200
Just get behind me for now!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.450
I know!

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.050
Dammit!

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:49.350
What the hell are you doing? You're losing speed!

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:55.470
The AI keeps getting in the way of how I want to fly!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:59.090
If we let you fly the way you wanted, you wouldn't be in the air for long.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.120
What?!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.980
Okay, then.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:11.860
To increase mobility, fighters sacrifice stability.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.260
Learn your place.

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:22.760
Do you get it now, vomit boy?

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.420
Come on! Hack! Zack!

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:30.840
Dammit!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.520
You're not...

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.840
getting away today!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.280
You can't count on your tail to save you this time!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.790
For goodness' sake.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.730
I took my eyes off him for a moment...

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:19.640
If you're looking for Cadet Hayate, I saw him earlier...

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:20.260
Sign: Ragnyannyan

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:29.390
That damn mercat!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:31.930
It was pretty close.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:32.760
What...

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:35.860
was pretty close?

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.880
Uh...

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.320
I hear the jellyfish god calling for me!

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:43.010
I'll leave the rest to you! Peace!

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:46.180
That's evil.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:52.840
What's the matter? I attend practice.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.340
That's not enough.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:11:00.640
I was told the Delta Platoon's job is to protect Walkure, not fight.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.930
Fighting still happens.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:07.180
You were at Al-Shahal. We fly on the battlefield.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:10.790
If you're not ready for that, leave.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.570
Do you enjoy flying like that?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.320
Enjoy it?

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.790
I'm a warrior.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.280
I fly to protect. That's all.

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.500
I see. Got it.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.880
A final exam?

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.010
Yes.

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:40.630
And who will be his opponent?

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.410
I will be flying against him.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.220
Did you hear?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:52.380
Yeah, Mirage and the cadet are gonna have a showdown.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:53.730
Showdown! Quarrel!

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.560
The tangles of love!

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.730
That really isn't it.

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:00.710
What do you think about the upcoming mock battle?

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.680
The cadet will be up against a Jenius elite.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:05.410
That poor kid is done for.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.810
Four! One! Two! Three! Four!

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:09.660
One! Two! Three! Four!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.510
One! Two! Three! Four!

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:12.640
One! Two!

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:13.550
Freyja!

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.710
Sorry!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.200
One more time from the top!

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.630
You can't afford to have your mind elsewhere!

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:22.630
Her fold receptor's not active.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.500
No biological fold waves.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.390
I wonder why.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:33.890
Fold receptors generate fold 
waves in sync with our minds.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:39.730
On the battlefield or when her life's in danger, her reaction will be stronger.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.570
She might be the type who only pulls through when the stakes are high.

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:47.030
She can't see her feet.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:50.950
You can't fly if you only look at the sky.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:58.180
My rune was useless again today...

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.350
It's so quick at running away.

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:03.790
Yeah. But I've seen all its moves!

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.430
Next time it's done for!

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:06.760
Heck, yeah!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.950
No more...

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:13.520
How are your lessons?

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.040
So much fun!

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:19.160
Running so high I can barely stand at the end of the day!

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.980
How I envy you.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:24.390
I heard your final exam is coming up.

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:26.110
Are you sure you should be here?

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:29.160
I can't seem to get the hang of it.

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:33.830
Back then, when I flew for the first time...

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:37.370
I could hear your song and feel the wind...

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:41.480
It was a good feeling.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:49.200
Well, I can't just go down here, can I now?

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.810
I'm gonna wipe the grin off my strict instructor's face!

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.150
You have a really creepy laugh, you know?

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:01.020
Wh-What about my laugh?!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.340
Well, what's so funny?

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:06.530
I just thought about how hard you're gonna fail!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.740
I'm not gonna fail!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.060
Hey, wait up!

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.090
You've got five minutes.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:26.050
If you can land a hit on Mirage, then you win, Hayate.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:29.760
To give him a chance, Hayate can take any number of hits.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.530
Messer will be the judge.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:33.190
Start off by turning left and right respectively.

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.870
The exam begins as soon as you pass each other!

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:37.040
Roger!

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.190
Distance: 5000.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.900
4000.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.310
3000.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:45.610
2000.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.610
1000.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.620
Start!

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:53.500
What?

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:56.870
Get good.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:09.230
<i>If you can see where the sky ends</i>

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:15.720
<i>If you can hear my voice shaking</i>

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:21.690
<i>Come and dance until you fall apart</i>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:25.530
<i>Shredded memories will give you...</i>

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.040
Hayate?

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:44.360
If we passed someone who's this unskilled, they'd just get killed in their first battle.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.430
In that case...

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:46.510
What the heck?!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.110
Good reaction!

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.540
My plane moved on its own!

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.990
In that case...

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:03.750
What?

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.080
Watch this!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:08.890
Are you nuts?

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.110
Shut up, vomit girl!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.320
God...

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.080
Blue's altitude dropping sharply!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.490
He seems to have lost control!

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.530
He lost control?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.240
Oh crap.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:22.000
Cadet Hayate Immelmann, eject immediately!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.170
Shut up!

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.630
I won't be able to fly if I lose now!

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.500
I guess I was wrong.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.270
Mirage, eject him.

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:32.880
Roger!

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:38.350
I can't. He cut off remote control along with the AI!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.680
Is he out of his mind?!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.310
Firefighters! Ambulance!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:43.460
We have an emergency!

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.500
Roger!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:46.860
Hayate!

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.480
Where do you think you're going?

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.150
Your lesson is not over.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.320
But Hayate—

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:56.070
He's fighting on his own battlefield.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.370
Freyja Wion!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.780
Um, yes?

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:05.660
Where is your battlefield?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.580
My battlefield?

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.920
I see.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.840
Hayate's fighting too.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:32.280
<i>If you can see where the sky ends</i>

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:39.450
<i>If you can hear my voice shaking</i>

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:46.410
<i>Come and dance until you fall apart</i>

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:52.840
<i>Shredded memories will give you limitless wings</i>

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:59.280
<i>How we talked that day... How we'd always laugh...</i>

00:17:58.890 --> 00:17:59.760
A song?

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:05.060
<i>Just keep standing up until the day of rebirth comes</i>

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.930
Fold receptors active.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:10.850
<i>Break me, come, come now, and feel me more</i>

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:09.640
Freyja!

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:13.890
<i>Are you, are you there?</i>

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:18.890
<i>Let us blaze through the battlefield we live</i>

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:23.000
<i>Kill me now, if I'm, if I'm to fall anyway</i>

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:26.040
<i>Or live, live and see the end of destruction</i>

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:24.240
Hayate!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:30.170
<i>Call on a miracle</i>

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:34.750
<i>Draw its light to the closed skies</i>

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.380
Hayate!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:43.000
<i>Among all these swirling sensations</i>

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:48.890
<i>I'm afraid I'll lose sight of my very self</i>

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.430
The scared the crap out of me.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:55.320
<i>Under the concentrated fire of anxiety</i>

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.600
Hayate...

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.620
The exam isn't over yet, ma'am!

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:54.110
What?

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.320
Here I go!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:19:01.110
<i>Only the strength to be weak prevails</i>

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.870
Give up already, Cadet Hayate!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:04.540
<i>If it wasn't me</i>

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:07.510
<i>If it wasn't you</i>

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:13.500
<i>We would've never known how good this feels</i>

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.160
Got you!

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:19.420
<i>Shred your way, your way into the darkness</i>

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:22.300
<i>Run, run until you tun into ashes</i>

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.890
That's it!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:27.020
<i>Then you can fall and scream, scream</i>

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.030
He did a mercat turn!

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:27.020
He passes.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:31.390
<i>Cut your way through to the star where I'll be born</i>

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:31.370
I... lost?

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:34.460
<i>Because, because if you'll be there for me</i>

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:43.120
<i>Together, our light will become invincible</i>

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.620
He's dancing.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.890
Pretty!

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:48.290
Her song did it?

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.540
Should we call it the Immelmann dance?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:57.210
<i>Break me, come, come now, and feel me more</i>

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.400
This feels nice!

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:00.460
How long are you going to keep prancing around?

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:02.180
What was that for? It's not fair!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.030
Such is the battlefield.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:07.620
Gallant one-on-one duels are a fallacy.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:10.310
You're flying the newest fighter!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.770
If you want to survive, learn how to fight.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.860
Hayate!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:30.680
Get lost!

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.910
I'm sorry. You were right.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:36.460
Just being able to fly isn't enough.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.670
But I still don't like the shooting business,

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.520
so I'll do things my way!

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:46.390
I'm looking forward to your classes tomorrow, instructor Mirage!

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.450
See you!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:54.970
You did it!

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:57.110
What was that about? You scared the crap outta us!

00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:59.940
You passed your exam!

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:04.240
Easy peasy!

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.080
Aren't you the lucky one?

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.300
Yeah! That's right!

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:11.620
Well said!

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:15.340
Did he feel the wind with his body?

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:18.630
Is that why you teamed him up 
with Miss Goody Two Shoes?

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.840
Who knows?

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.800
Mission 03: A Stormy Dogfight

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.640
Are you ready now?

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:46.820
<i>I heard a rumor saying the world's gonna end someday</i>

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:52.330
<i>Just kidding, that's so obvious</i>

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:57.670
<i>I remember looking up at the sky</i>

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:01.380
<i>and feeling like I was in the future</i>

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:06.980
<i>I felt completely in sync with your wind</i>

00:22:08.940 --> 00:22:15.980
<i>I finally found a place where I could be a girl</i>

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:23.480
<i>so I've got no choice but to do it. I can't stop now!</i>

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:25.070
You better be ready!

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>If my rune shines with a flash</i>

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:32.410
<i>(wow wow wowow)</i>

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.900
<i>I fall in love</i>

00:22:35.900 --> 00:22:39.370
<i>(wow wow wowow)</i>

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:44.920
<i>Lalali lalala it's your fault</i>

00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:52.710
<i>Lalala I feel peerless when my rune flashes{fuck this shit}</i>

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:16.570
Is that you, Roid?

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:22.110
Your Majesty, please return to your room.

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:23.960
Please do not risk your health.

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:26.100
You are right.

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:31.930
We are about to stir up a great wind.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:35.860
Indeed, Your Majesty.

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.770
Next time: A Shocking Debut Show

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:39.860
